OL,3,GNEWSAB&B boss fears 'uneven playing
OL,4,Afield' over tourist tax
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Scarborough bed and breakfast owner
OL,7,Fhas said businesses like his will face
OL,8,Fan "uneven playing field" if a
OL,9,Fso-called tourist tax is introduced in
OL,10,FNorth Yorkshire but not in neighbouring
OL,11,FEast Yorkshire.
OL,13,FA consultation on plans for a visitor
OL,14,Flevy closed in February and legislation
OL,15,Fis expected to be brought forward later
OL,16,Fthis year.
OL,23,APub: 01-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
