OL,3,GNEWSAB&B boss fears 'uneven playing
OL,4,Afield' over tourist tax
OL,5,
OL,6,FJames Rusden, who runs Scarborough's
OL,7,FToulson Court B&B, said if the levy was
OL,8,Fnot England-wide, cost-of-living
OL,9,Fpressures would mean some visitors
OL,10,Fwould instead go where no tourist tax
OL,11,Fwas being charged.
OL,13,FA government spokesperson said: "We're
OL,14,Flistening to businesses in Yorkshire
OL,15,Fand across the country on this so we
OL,16,Fmake sure money raised is invested in
OL,17,Flocal priorities."
